Cell["\<\
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\
-----------------------------------+
|\t\t\t\tThis section loads the solution that comes out  \t\t\t\t |
|\t\t\t\tfrom solving the linear system of equations and  \t\t\t\t |
|\t\t\t\tcompares it to the constructed solution above. \t\t\t\t |
|\t\t\t\tIt does so analytically and numerically.\t\t\t\t\t\t |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\
-----------------------------------+\
\>", "Text",
